   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Grow Wings and Fly**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **You Can Be Your Silhouette**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-11-17** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 136 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-17.THOR**: source not stated; 3 songs; 135 min [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-17.bandcampbootlegger**: soundboard; 0 songs; 136 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mardi Gras World staff hosted the recording crew at the New Orleans venue [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-11-17**: taped by Twenty8; transferred by Twenty8; source: Audio Technica 3031 > Sound Devices MixPre 6ii [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-17.THOR**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK THORs>PMD661>24/96 wav [2]. Also: Taper ted chopped xlrs into Oade concert mod Marantz PMD661; ADK T7 THORs positioned ORTF FOB, 100 feet from stage [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-17.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Concert Poster For New Orleans Los Angeles At Mardi Gras World On November 17 2024 Ho](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-concert-poster-for-new-orleans-los-angeles-at-mardi-gras-world-on-november-17-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]\n- Fan art by @swaycout: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Mardi Gras World New Orleans LA Novemebr 17 2024 Poster](https://swaycout.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-mardi-gras-world-new-orleans-la-novemebr-17-2024-poster/) [6]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Concert Poster For New Orleans Los Angeles At Mardi Gras World On November 17 2024 Al](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-concert-poster-for-new-orleans-los-angeles-at-mardi-gras-world-on-november-17-2024-all-over-print-shirt/) [7]",
